  "document": "Sins of Madeleine\nSins of Madeleine( French: Dupont Barbès) is a 1951 French drama film directed by Henri Lepage and starring Madeleine Lebeau, Henri Vilbert and Yves Furet. It was shot at the Epinay Studios in Paris. The film's sets were designed by the art director Claude Bouxin."
